    cof:title "2 Commencement" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 1 and 2 commence on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent.  (2) Subject to subsection (3), the remaining provisions of this Act commence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation.  (3) If the provisions referred to in subsection (2) do not commence under that subsection within the period of 12 months beginning on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent, they commence on the first day after the end of that period." ;
