    skos:prefLabel "5 Ratification of cooperative scheme"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "To the extent that it lies within the legislative competence of the Commonwealth to give the cooperative scheme the force of law, it has the force of law.   Application of criminal law outside adjacent area  Part 3  Section 6  Crimes at Sea Act 2000 Compilation date: 30/8/19 Registered: 2/9/19" ;
    skos:definition "To the extent that it lies within the legislative competence of the Commonwealth to give the cooperative scheme the force of law, it has the force of law.   Application of criminal law outside adjacent area  Part 3  Section 6  Crimes at Sea Act 2000 Compilation date: 30/8/19 Registered: 2/9/19"@en ;
