concept:crimes-at-sea-act-2000-sch-1-sec-7-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(3) Commonwealth Attorney-General’s consent required for certain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Even though the Commonwealth Attorney-General has not granted such a consent, the absence of consent is not to prevent or delay:  (a) the arrest of the suspected offender or proceedings related to arrest (such as proceedings for the issue and execution of a warrant); or  (b) the laying of a charge against the suspected offender; or  (c) proceedings for the extradition to Australia of the suspected offender; or  (d) proceedings for remanding the suspected offender in custody or on bail." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Even though the Commonwealth Attorney-General has not granted such a consent, the absence of consent is not to prevent or delay:  (a) the arrest of the suspected offender or proceedings related to arrest (such as proceedings for the issue and execution of a warrant); or  (b) the laying of a charge against the suspected offender; or  (c) proceedings for the extradition to Australia of the suspected offender; or  (d) proceedings for remanding the suspected offender in custody or on bail."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ae8eda19fb037ab1f9f3d801be3c4fdbc66357a861762591ce6a68353278eed7" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-at-sea-act-2000-sch-1-sec-7 ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commonwealth Attorney-general's consent required for certain actions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
