    values:originalText "(5) In any proceedings, an apparently genuine document purporting to be a copy of a written consent granted by the Commonwealth  The cooperative scheme  Schedule 1 Limitations and exclusions  Part 4  Clause 8  Crimes at Sea Act 2000 Compilation date: 30/8/19 Registered: 2/9/19  Attorney-General in accordance with this clause will be accepted, in the absence of proof to the contrary, as proof of such consent." ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-at-sea-act-2000-sch-1-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Non-exclusion of consistent extraterritorial legislative schemes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "This scheme does not exclude the extraterritorial operation of State law to the extent that the State law is capable of operating extraterritorially consistently with the scheme." ;
